      "description": "The meme is designed to incite hostility toward the Democratic Party by blaming them for a catastrophic event (the 'near-death' of the baby), using the party as a scapegoat. This targets individuals who identify with or support the Democratic Party, or those who are politically aligned with its policies, particularly regarding immigration and social issues.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
